      "content": "hey so im working on a new high fantasy novel. i need help with some world building. basically i have these main characters who are from this very enlightened, highly civilized empire with lots of tech and law. but i need a massive threat for them to face. i'm thinking of an antagonist group that is the total opposite—more dark, exotic, and threatening. like a primitive, untamed culture that lives in the wilds and doesn't follow any of the \"civilized\" rules. can you help me brainstorm some details for these people to make them feel really distinct and scary compared to the protagonists?",
